{"title": "Call of the Crustacean", "pageid": 37739, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Call_of_the_Crustacean", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Bonus actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Cat.webp, /w/images/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Call of the Crustacean </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 conjuration spell</a>. This spell summons an <a href=\"/wiki/Armoured_Crab\" title=\"Armoured Crab\">Armoured Crab</a> to fight alongside the caster. It cannot be learned by party members.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nConjure an <a href=\"/wiki/Armoured_Crab\" title=\"Armoured Crab\">Armoured Crab</a> to fight alongside you. The crab can use <a href=\"/wiki/Razor_Claw\" title=\"Razor Claw\">Razor Claw</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>This spell can be upcast to level 4 once per battle to summon 6 crabs instead of 1.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_HagSurvivors_Summon</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_HagSurvivors_Summon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_HagSurvivors_Summon\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report